    <string name="onboarding_title_1">Manage your groceries, cosmetics, and shop stock more smartly. Say goodbye to expired items!</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_2">One small note from you is a big step toward less waste and more savings. Track every expiry date with ease.</string>
